---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { buildWebAppSchema } from '../../lib/schema';
import toolContent from '../../tools-content/paint-selector.html?raw';

const appSchema = buildWebAppSchema({
  name: "Airbrush Paint Selector",
  description: "Find the right airbrush-ready paint for your surface, finish and application type.",
  path: "/tools/paint-selector/",
  free: true,
});
---
<BaseLayout title="Airbrush Paint Selector | AirbrushDOC" description="Find the right paint for your surface and application type.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(appSchema)} />
  <main class="abd-container" style="padding: 40px 24px 80px;">
    <nav class="abd-breadcrumbs" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="abd-breadcrumbs-sep">›</span>
      <a href="/tools/">Tools</a>
      <span class="abd-breadcrumbs-sep">›</span>
      <span>Airbrush Paint Selector</span>
    </nav>
    <Fragment set:html={toolContent} />
  
    <section class="tool-about">
      <h2>How to use the paint selector</h2>
      <p>Tell the tool what you are painting on and what the finished piece has to survive, and
    it narrows the paint families down to the ones that will actually bond. Surface is the deciding
    factor: what works on primed plastic will lift off bare polyethylene, and what survives a
    washing machine is not what you want on a display model.</p>
    <p>The other half of the decision is thinning. Urethanes and solvent paints need their own
    reducers and proper ventilation; water-based acrylics are far more forgiving to mix and clean
    up, which is why they suit almost everyone starting out.</p>
      <p class="tool-about-next"><strong>Read next:</strong> <a href="/blog/advanced-guide-to-airbrush-colors/">Airbrush paint types compared: which to buy</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.tool-about {
  max-width: 68ch;
  margin: 48px auto 0;
  padding: 28px 0 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border, #2a2a2a);
}
.tool-about h2 {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.tool-about p {
  color: var(--abd-text-dim);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.tool-about-next { margin-top: 18px; }
</style>
